# Microservices E-Commerce App Deployment on AWS

## Overview

This project demonstrates a complete DevOps deployment pipeline for a microservices-based e-commerce application using:

* Java Spring Boot microservices
* Docker & Docker Compose
* Terraform Infrastructure as Code
* GitHub Actions CI/CD
* AWS EC2
* AWS Security Groups

The deployment pipeline automatically:

1. Creates infrastructure on AWS using Terraform
2. Launches an EC2 instance
3. Installs Docker automatically
4. Copies application files to EC2
5. Deploys containers using Docker Compose

---

# Architecture

```text
Developer Push
      ↓
GitHub Actions
      ↓
Terraform
      ↓
AWS EC2 + Security Group
      ↓
Docker + Docker Compose
      ↓
Spring Boot Microservices
```

---

